        "created_at": "2026-02-15T21:58:49.257Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I simply have <code>https://github.com/Gethe/wow-ui-source</code> checked out and added to my VSCode workspace. Whenever necessary I tell GitHub Copilot (mostly using Claude Sonnett/Opus or Gemini) to look up the problem in the wow-ui-source files and it almost always finds the issue. When the source code updates or when I need to switch between retail/classic, I simply pull or change the branch of the wow-ui-source repo.</p>",
